{"annotations":{"destructiveHint":false,"idempotentHint":true,"openWorldHint":true,"readOnlyHint":true,"title":"Search and Geocode Tool"},"description":"Search for POIs, brands, chains, geocode cities, towns, addresses. Do not use for generic place types such as 'museums', 'coffee shops', 'tacos', etc, because category_search_tool is better for that. Setting a proximity point is strongly encouraged for more local results. The underlying Search Box API is rolling out natural-language query understanding (e.g. 'quiet coffee shops with wifi near downtown'), so richer free-text phrasing in `q` can work well for category + place + attribute combinations \u2014 but as of this writing, big-box retail brand searches tied to a specific address (e.g. 'Costco near <address>', 'Walmart near <address>', 'Target near <address>') are unreliable and often return unrelated results; verify those results before relying on them.","execution":{"taskSupport":"forbidden"},"inputSchema":{"$schema":"https://json-schema.org/draft/2020-12/schema","properties":{"auto_complete":{"description":"Enable partial and fuzzy matching","type":"boolean"},"bbox":{"description":"Bounding box to limit results within [minLon, minLat, maxLon, maxLat]","properties":{"maxLatitude":{"maximum":90,"minimum":-90,"type":"number"},"maxLongitude":{"maximum":180,"minimum":-180,"type":"number"},"minLatitude":{"maximum":90,"minimum":-90,"type":"number"},"minLongitude":{"maximum":180,"minimum":-180,"type":"number"}},"required":["minLongitude","minLatitude","maxLongitude","maxLatitude"],"type":"object"},"country":{"description":"Array of ISO 3166 alpha 2 country codes to limit results","items":{"maxLength":2,"minLength":2,"type":"string"},"type":"array"},"eta_type":{"description":"Request estimated time of arrival (ETA) to results","enum":["navigation"],"type":"string"},"language":{"description":"ISO language code for the response (e.g., \"en\", \"es\", \"fr\", \"de\", \"ja\")","type":"string"},"navigation_profile":{"desc